Package: UpuEpoDE
Title: Geolocator Study of Eurasian Hoopoes in Germany
URL: https://github.com/<org>/<repo>
Description: Pressure and light based multi-sensor geolocator tracking of
    Eurasian Hoopoes (Upupa epops) breeding in nest boxes in Marienfliess,
    northern Germany, between 2023 and 2026. Includes raw tag data, manual
    light and pressure labeling, and the GeoPressureR analysis workflow used
    to reconstruct migratory trajectories.
